{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GIRL.EXE.EXE</strong> is a psychological horror puzzle game where reality intertwines with code, and glitches become part of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You return to an abandoned project\u2014a game you once wanted to finish but never could. Now, it has a life of its own. The world is breaking, scenes are distorting, and the one who remains inside doesn\u2019t want you to leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore corrupted levels, fix bugs, and avoid the traps set by the game itself. But be careful\u2014not every error wants to be erased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udda5 <strong>Unique gameplay</strong> \u2013 modify the code, alter reality, and escape paradoxes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc41 <strong>Distorted locations</strong> \u2013 every room is filled with surprises, anomalies, and echoes of the past.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfad <strong>Mannequins and glitches</strong> \u2013 some are just errors\u2026 but some are watching you.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Punishments for mistakes</strong> \u2013 misinterpret a bug, and you\u2019ll fall into a deadly trap.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udda4 <strong>A story about acceptance</strong> \u2013 the game will only end when you're ready.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude02 <strong>Dark humor &amp; absurd moments</strong> \u2013 not all bugs are terrifying\u2026 some are just plain ridiculous.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf99 <strong>Expressive voice acting</strong> \u2013 the girl\u2019s taunts, eerie whispers, and playful threats bring the world to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finish the game. Or let it finish you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590890?t=1742706785","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgroun